  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "FIXED\n- iOS and Mac Catalyst: an `Unknown` or failed free-trial eligibility answer is no longer kept with the cached offerings. 10.2.0 kept it until `GetOfferings(forceRefresh: true)`, so after a StoreKit hiccup an eligible user saw no `ProductDto.FreeTrialPeriod` for the rest of the session. Now every later `GetOfferings()` asks again until the answer is definite.\n- iOS and Mac Catalyst: a `GetOfferings()` call that arrived while another one was still checking eligibility read the new offerings with the old answer (none on the first load), so an eligible user got no trial. Offerings and eligibility are now cached together.\n\nNOTE\n- No API change, and the bindings are the same as in 10.1.0.",
